  "title": "Carbon Stocks of Individual Trees in African Drylands: Allometry and Output Data -- Cloud formats",
  "description": "Cloud-optimized GeoTIFF versions of allometry and output data characterizing carbon stocks of individual trees across African drylands, spanning the Sahel and Sahara regions. The dataset provides tree-level carbon estimates derived via machine learning from satellite imagery, covering approximately West to East Africa (18\u00b0W\u201342\u00b0E, 9\u00b0N\u201324\u00b0N). Original data published at ORNL DAAC by Tucker et al. (2022).",
